055681: Only allowed parent process to construct protocol for ClearStoragesForOrigin.  a=RyanVM DONTBUILD\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D315148\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D320450\n", "files": ["dom/storage/components.conf", "ipc/glue/BackgroundParentImpl.cpp", "ipc/glue/BackgroundParentImpl.h"], "git_node": "80a1023817d04f888a152aee7a88f9f54c619ff6", "git_parents": ["4ee69fbd0db5fce9683101854c01d0a856fd838c"], "node": "0b2fafbf0b267e783a4e8882d3a08339d74593d5", "parents": ["a0b05c4c2f874e8608e16204107a3b4afc6c491f"], "tags": []}], "date": 1787413893, "git_changesets": ["80a1023817d04f888a152aee7a88f9f54c619ff6"], "user": "rvandermeulen@mozilla.com"}, "1599": {"changesets": [{"author": "Bob Owen \u003cbobowencode@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2058087 p1 - Pre-create shader-cache to allow read only rule.  a=RyanVM DONTBUILD\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D317559\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D320457\n", "files": ["security/sandbox/win/src/sandboxbroker/sandboxBroker.cpp"], "git_node": "dbf9699d9ff52176f6e14ba7acda0b5225c61ecb", "git_parents": ["80a1023817d04f888a152aee7a88f9f54c619ff6"], "node": "34c575aaf0d2b6ca13b8af1e877c6694f6871b55", "parents": ["0b2fafbf0b267e783a4e8882d3a08339d74593d5"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Bob Owen \u003cbobowencode@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2058087 p2 - Block directory creation and only allow read access.  a=RyanVM DONTBUILD\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D317560\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D320458\n", "files": ["security/sandbox/chromium-shim/patches/55_dont_broker_dir_creation_or_write.patch", "security/sandbox/chromium/sandbox/win/src/filesystem_dispatcher.cc"], "git_node": "3187bf98809e14d847806e289e28e273c5b12bc1", "git_parents": ["dbf9699d9ff52176f6e14ba7acda0b5225c61ecb"], "